	"Name": "Kenneth's English Country Garden",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]Kenneth's English Country Garden - Content Patcher[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This mod adds 6 new crops: Chamomile, Echinacea, Lavender, Mint, Rosemary and Sage.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]All crops are seasonal and regrowable.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]It also adds 6 teas and Fish and Chips.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Seeds are sold at Kenneth's Seed Shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Teas are sold at Kenneth's Drink Shop.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Fish and Chips is sold at Kenneth's Restaurant.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]All items can also be cooked with cooking recipes.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This mod is balanced for vanilla gameplay and designed to fit naturally into the game.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Credits:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Original mod and sprites by RunsWithPencils.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Content Patcher version by Kf, used with permission.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=4]Original Mod: https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12039[/size][/b]",
